(6005766, 880348, 65319, '<td valign="top">Well, here she is!  Mom at her best with the all important camera in hand and enjoying what most likely is a photo of YOU on the back of the camera''s viewer screen.  This photo presents a lovely candid pose of your mom!  Her beautiful smile is a natural expression of her delight and not "posed" at all!  The only nattering naybob nitpick I would suggest is an improved lighting source and try photographing your mom in a scene of some kind to create a stronger story for your portrait.  Beautiful work...looking forward to more from you!  (no vote...comment only).</td>', 'Well, here she is!  Mom at her best with the all important camera in hand and enjoying what most likely is a photo of YOU on the back of the camera''s viewer screen.  This photo presents a lovely candid pose of your mom!  Her beautiful smile is a natural expression of her delight and not "posed" at all!  The only nattering naybob nitpick I would suggest is an improved lighting source and try photographing your mom in a scene of some kind to create a stronger story for your portrait.  Beautiful work...looking forward to more from you!  (no vote...comment only).', '2010-05-13 13:18:06.000000', NULL, 1),
