(6005882, 880091, 83313, '<td valign="top">Aha, the old "hide behind the camera" trick. Come out, come out, wherever you are!</td>', 'Aha, the old "hide behind the camera" trick. Come out, come out, wherever you are!', '2010-05-13 14:45:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(6005883, 880425, 83313, '<td valign="top">Effective use of a wideangle lens as well as a pecan pie.</td>', 'Effective use of a wideangle lens as well as a pecan pie.', '2010-05-13 14:45:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(6005887, 879356, 83313, '<td valign="top">Good use of the reflections. Between that and the tie, it sets the context nicely.</td>', 'Good use of the reflections. Between that and the tie, it sets the context nicely.', '2010-05-13 14:48:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(6005888, 880131, 83313, '<td valign="top">Love the hair!</td>', 'Love the hair!', '2010-05-13 14:51:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(6005891, 879212, 35348, '<td valign="top">the DP member is out of focus. overall the composition is okay, nice background, though for this type of portrait I would use portrait orientation and push in closer to the subject to crop out some background. or pull back and shoot full body. leaving it cropped at the waist is awkward</td>', 'the DP member is out of focus. overall the composition is okay, nice background, though for this type of portrait I would use portrait orientation and push in closer to the subject to crop out some background. or pull back and shoot full body. leaving it cropped at the waist is awkward', '2010-05-13 14:56:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(6005893, 880053, 83313, '<td valign="top">Very nice portrait of him, but I kinda expected a little quirky humor from you in this challenge. You know, with that hair of his, Ryan would make a great caveman. Wouldn''t you like to be dragged back to his cave? On the other hand, that''s my own trademarked schtick.</td>', 'Very nice portrait of him, but I kinda expected a little quirky humor from you in this challenge. You know, with that hair of his, Ryan would make a great caveman. Wouldn''t you like to be dragged back to his cave? On the other hand, that''s my own trademarked schtick.', '2010-05-13 14:57:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(6005896, 880021, 35348, '<td valign="top">even though its a little OOF, I really like the feel in this picture, between the soft focus and the overexposure, this image gets a very dreamlike feel. Very nicely done!</td>', 'even though its a little OOF, I really like the feel in this picture, between the soft focus and the overexposure, this image gets a very dreamlike feel. Very nicely done!', '2010-05-13 14:59:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(6005899, 880413, 83313, '<td valign="top">You know, in this pic, he looks a bit like <a href="//twit.tv/ttg664" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">Leo Laporte</a>. Or maybe Leo looks like Scarbrd...</td>', 'You know, in this pic, he looks a bit like Leo Laporte. Or maybe Leo looks like Scarbrd...', '2010-05-13 15:02:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(6005902, 879431, 83313, '<td valign="top">I thought it was waiting up for <strike>troll</strike>rollover that did it.</td>', 'I thought it was waiting up for trollrollover that did it.', '2010-05-13 15:03:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(6005906, 880243, 35348, '<td valign="top">looks like your going for a Richard Avedon feel here, with the clean background and the almost stern expression, which I love! I would push in closer, cropping closer to the waist, which would emphasize the subjects expression. Also in this kind of image i find the color distracting, I would really "Avedon" it out and go black and white! Overall very good image!</td>', 'looks like your going for a Richard Avedon feel here, with the clean background and the almost stern expression, which I love! I would push in closer, cropping closer to the waist, which would emphasize the subjects expression. Also in this kind of image i find the color distracting, I would really "Avedon" it out and go black and white! Overall very good image!', '2010-05-13 15:04:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(6005915, 880518, 35348, '<td valign="top">a combination of Gump from the movie ''Legend'' and Gollum from LOTR...I love the whimsical, vintage feel! 10</td>', 'a combination of Gump from the movie ''Legend'' and Gollum from LOTR...I love the whimsical, vintage feel! 10', '2010-05-13 15:08:54.000000', NULL, 1);
