(6006994, 880501, 63503, '<td valign="top">Nice portrait, great focus and skin tone. I wonder if it would have not looked even better without the blueish hue and the resulting halo (not voting)</td>', 'Nice portrait, great focus and skin tone. I wonder if it would have not looked even better without the blueish hue and the resulting halo (not voting)', '2010-05-14 11:16:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(6007009, 880021, 63503, '<td valign="top">Very nice effort and interesting result. The resulting unevenness of the eyes (in terms of light and focus) does not appear to work well here, at least IMHO.</td>', 'Very nice effort and interesting result. The resulting unevenness of the eyes (in terms of light and focus) does not appear to work well here, at least IMHO.', '2010-05-14 11:26:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(6007012, 880400, 83313, '<td valign="top">I like the quirkiness of her leaning into the frame from the side.<br/> <br/>Added: Duh! I just realized her hair is sideways meaning that''s a fence, not a bridge. Still quirky.</td>', 'I like the quirkiness of her leaning into the frame from the side. Added: Duh! I just realized her hair is sideways meaning that''s a fence, not a bridge. Still quirky.', '2010-05-14 11:29:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(6007015, 879994, 63503, '<td valign="top">Great shot!!! I am a fan of this guy and this is a great picture with lighting in the own style of the subject, what could be a better tribute? This will probably ribbon. (not voting)</td>', 'Great shot!!! I am a fan of this guy and this is a great picture with lighting in the own style of the subject, what could be a better tribute? This will probably ribbon. (not voting)', '2010-05-14 11:30:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(6007026, 880258, 63503, '<td valign="top">Excellent lighting and great choice of aperture !!! (not voting)</td>', 'Excellent lighting and great choice of aperture !!! (not voting)', '2010-05-14 11:40:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(6007028, 880026, 63503, '<td valign="top">Great light and expression. I assume he wanted to (or you wanted him to)appear as a tough scary guy, if that is the case it may have worked better with a lower point of view, I think. It is hard to be intimidated by a guy you are looking down on. Great picture though. (not voting)</td>', 'Great light and expression. I assume he wanted to (or you wanted him to)appear as a tough scary guy, if that is the case it may have worked better with a lower point of view, I think. It is hard to be intimidated by a guy you are looking down on. Great picture though. (not voting)', '2010-05-14 11:40:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(6007029, 879431, 63503, '<td valign="top">Holy cow !! you should patent the beer drinking rig.</td>', 'Holy cow !! you should patent the beer drinking rig.', '2010-05-14 11:40:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(6007030, 880361, 63503, '<td valign="top">Nice shot (not voting)</td>', 'Nice shot (not voting)', '2010-05-14 11:41:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(6007033, 880487, 63503, '<td valign="top">Great light, composition and process, should ribbon (not voting)</td>', 'Great light, composition and process, should ribbon (not voting)', '2010-05-14 11:42:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(6007035, 879618, 63503, '<td valign="top">Beautiful portrait with great lighting, choice pf aperture and process (not voting)</td>', 'Beautiful portrait with great lighting, choice pf aperture and process (not voting)', '2010-05-14 11:44:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(6007037, 880470, 63503, '<td valign="top">Wow!! great portrait !! I assume he dressed up for the ocassion or do we really have a tribe guy in DPC? (not voting)</td>', 'Wow!! great portrait !! I assume he dressed up for the ocassion or do we really have a tribe guy in DPC? (not voting)', '2010-05-14 11:46:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(6007040, 879902, 63503, '<td valign="top">I think this may be the girl that leaps in the air with flying multicolor veils, she is incredibly beautiful and this is a great portrait of hers. Good luck !! (not voting)</td>', 'I think this may be the girl that leaps in the air with flying multicolor veils, she is incredibly beautiful and this is a great portrait of hers. Good luck !! (not voting)', '2010-05-14 11:48:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(6007042, 880400, 63503, '<td valign="top">Very creative point of view and rotation resulting a most pleasant composition. Good luck (not voting)</td>', 'Very creative point of view and rotation resulting a most pleasant composition. Good luck (not voting)', '2010-05-14 11:50:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(6007046, 880199, 63503, '<td valign="top">Very beautiful lady with incredible eyes, and great portrait too!! (not voting)</td>', 'Very beautiful lady with incredible eyes, and great portrait too!! (not voting)', '2010-05-14 11:52:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(6007047, 880267, 63503, '<td valign="top">Great light !!! (not voting)</td>', 'Great light !!! (not voting)', '2010-05-14 11:52:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(6007050, 879879, 63503, '<td valign="top">This guy is gonna turn into a professional model after this challenge (not voting)</td>', 'This guy is gonna turn into a professional model after this challenge (not voting)', '2010-05-14 11:54:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(6007061, 880410, 63503, '<td valign="top">Nice work by the model, beautiful expression and posing. Unfortunately the lighting is too harsh; I am sorry but the hard arm and banana shadows ruin what could have been a great portrait (not voting)</td>', 'Nice work by the model, beautiful expression and posing. Unfortunately the lighting is too harsh; I am sorry but the hard arm and banana shadows ruin what could have been a great portrait (not voting)', '2010-05-14 12:05:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(6007062, 879990, 63503, '<td valign="top">Great portrait!!! (not voting)</td>', 'Great portrait!!! (not voting)', '2010-05-14 12:05:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(6007074, 879846, 63503, '<td valign="top">Excellent portrait !! it is good to know what this guy looks like, it will now be even more enjoyable to read his sarcastic comments. (not voting)</td>', 'Excellent portrait !! it is good to know what this guy looks like, it will now be even more enjoyable to read his sarcastic comments. (not voting)', '2010-05-14 12:13:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(6007088, 880199, 96614, '<td valign="top">Awesome DOF here!  Amazing image!</td>', 'Awesome DOF here!  Amazing image!', '2010-05-14 12:24:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(6007089, 879431, 96614, '<td valign="top">Great idea, but a little more fill light on the face would be nice</td>', 'Great idea, but a little more fill light on the face would be nice', '2010-05-14 12:25:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(6007090, 880042, 96614, '<td valign="top">Love the back lighting!</td>', 'Love the back lighting!', '2010-05-14 12:25:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(6007091, 880399, 96614, '<td valign="top">Great idea! Saturation may need a boost as it looks a little flat</td>', 'Great idea! Saturation may need a boost as it looks a little flat', '2010-05-14 12:26:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(6007092, 879520, 96614, '<td valign="top">Awesome location!, try a reflector for some fill light on this side of his face  (even a piece of tin foil or white paper would work in a pinch</td>', 'Awesome location!, try a reflector for some fill light on this side of his face  (even a piece of tin foil or white paper would work in a pinch', '2010-05-14 12:27:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(6007093, 879787, 96614, '<td valign="top">Nice Depth of Field for a portrait</td>', 'Nice Depth of Field for a portrait', '2010-05-14 12:27:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(6007094, 879906, 96614, '<td valign="top">Nice sharp image, but IMO it wold look better if you took a step back and got his whole head in the shot</td>', 'Nice sharp image, but IMO it wold look better if you took a step back and got his whole head in the shot', '2010-05-14 12:28:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(6007097, 880487, 96614, '<td valign="top">Very creative with the selective De-Sat!</td>', 'Very creative with the selective De-Sat!', '2010-05-14 12:28:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(6007099, 880243, 96614, '<td valign="top">Nice job with the white backdrop, but it looks like all the light is coming from bottom left, try to make the light come from top left to hit his face more</td>', 'Nice job with the white backdrop, but it looks like all the light is coming from bottom left, try to make the light come from top left to hit his face more', '2010-05-14 12:29:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(6007100, 879098, 96614, '<td valign="top">Nice shot, now, I may be picky here, but I think that the focus is on the lips/eye brow... it should be on the eye ball... so either focus more on the eye, or stop down to catch the eye in the focus plane as well</td>', 'Nice shot, now, I may be picky here, but I think that the focus is on the lips/eye brow... it should be on the eye ball... so either focus more on the eye, or stop down to catch the eye in the focus plane as well', '2010-05-14 12:30:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(6007109, 879846, 96614, '<td valign="top">This one has great DOF, part of me wants to say that you shouldn''t have cropped his head so tight at the top, but the more I look at it, the more I like it... If I HAD to come up with one thing to say it would be that the light on the backdrop should be the same brightness on both his left and right... it''s a little too bright on one side as thought you lit it with a light from the side... try placing the light reight behind him so that lighting is even on left and right... but STILL I really think this shot is AMAZING!</td>', 'This one has great DOF, part of me wants to say that you shouldn''t have cropped his head so tight at the top, but the more I look at it, the more I like it... If I HAD to come up with one thing to say it would be that the light on the backdrop should be the same brightness on both his left and right... it''s a little too bright on one side as thought you lit it with a light from the side... try placing the light reight behind him so that lighting is even on left and right... but STILL I really think this shot is AMAZING!', '2010-05-14 12:35:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(6007111, 880043, 96614, '<td valign="top">Very creative idea!</td>', 'Very creative idea!', '2010-05-14 12:35:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(6007112, 879805, 96614, '<td valign="top">I really like the lighting in this one... is it sunset to the left, and reflector to the right?  Great job!</td>', 'I really like the lighting in this one... is it sunset to the left, and reflector to the right?  Great job!', '2010-05-14 12:36:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(6007114, 880501, 96614, '<td valign="top">Nice location!  one suggestion, when you are selectivly changing parts of your image, i.e. blue sky, zoom in closer when you erase arounf his head because I can see the different colour of the sky around his head.  I do lots of work like this for landscape images that I sell, and it does take time, but it''s worth it in the end,  keep this location in mind because I''m sure you''ll be able to take MANY more great shots here!</td>', 'Nice location!  one suggestion, when you are selectivly changing parts of your image, i.e. blue sky, zoom in closer when you erase arounf his head because I can see the different colour of the sky around his head.  I do lots of work like this for landscape images that I sell, and it does take time, but it''s worth it in the end,  keep this location in mind because I''m sure you''ll be able to take MANY more great shots here!', '2010-05-14 12:39:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(6007122, 879197, 96614, '<td valign="top">Great shot, one thing to suggest, is to have him move foreward so that when he blows the smoke, it is infront of a black area instead of part white and part black... the smoke really seals the deal for this shot, but it''s hard to see the way it is... still great shot!</td>', 'Great shot, one thing to suggest, is to have him move foreward so that when he blows the smoke, it is infront of a black area instead of part white and part black... the smoke really seals the deal for this shot, but it''s hard to see the way it is... still great shot!', '2010-05-14 12:40:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(6007130, 880258, 96614, '<td valign="top">Great shot... now, not to be picky, but I think it would look better if there was no catch light in his other eye... because it causes a little white dot there that is distracting... otherwise, great shot!</td>', 'Great shot... now, not to be picky, but I think it would look better if there was no catch light in his other eye... because it causes a little white dot there that is distracting... otherwise, great shot!', '2010-05-14 12:42:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(6007135, 880246, 96614, '<td valign="top">this is a great idea for a portrait, but I think that her face would look better with normal satruation as it is desaturated now with what looks like a sepia tint</td>', 'this is a great idea for a portrait, but I think that her face would look better with normal satruation as it is desaturated now with what looks like a sepia tint', '2010-05-14 12:43:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(6007147, 879618, 96614, '<td valign="top">This one, as with others here, I had to look at it a few times to really appreciate how great of a shot it is, you have done an amazing job with the catch light in his eyes here!  one thing... sorry to be picky... but that button... just at the bottom by the red line... the more I look at it the more it bugs me  =P   sorry... couldn''t resist saying it,,, but, you could have actually cropped it off and it would still have looked great...</td>', 'This one, as with others here, I had to look at it a few times to really appreciate how great of a shot it is, you have done an amazing job with the catch light in his eyes here!  one thing... sorry to be picky... but that button... just at the bottom by the red line... the more I look at it the more it bugs me  =P   sorry... couldn''t resist saying it,,, but, you could have actually cropped it off and it would still have looked great...', '2010-05-14 12:46:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(6007151, 880348, 96614, '<td valign="top">make sure she takes off that lens cap before she takes that picture  =)</td>', 'make sure she takes off that lens cap before she takes that picture  =)', '2010-05-14 12:46:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(6007153, 878880, 96614, '<td valign="top">Nice closeup, but I would have put his eye closer to the center of the image</td>', 'Nice closeup, but I would have put his eye closer to the center of the image', '2010-05-14 12:47:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(6007155, 879810, 96614, '<td valign="top">This is a great portrait with excellent lighting, but I think you have over processed it... I would love to see the original for comparison</td>', 'This is a great portrait with excellent lighting, but I think you have over processed it... I would love to see the original for comparison', '2010-05-14 12:47:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(6007156, 879865, 96614, '<td valign="top">Nicely done!</td>', 'Nicely done!', '2010-05-14 12:47:48.000000', NULL, 1),
