(6007295, 878512, 83313, '<td valign="top">Um,.... he''s a DPC member? I guess I''ll have to take your word for it.<br/> <br/>The image loses lots of detail and clarity to JPEG compression. With a 51k file size, you had a lot more overhead available to you. Always save for challenges with as little compression as you can manage and still slip in under the limit.</td>', 'Um,.... he''s a DPC member? I guess I''ll have to take your word for it. The image loses lots of detail and clarity to JPEG compression. With a 51k file size, you had a lot more overhead available to you. Always save for challenges with as little compression as you can manage and still slip in under the limit.', '2010-05-14 14:11:45.000000', NULL, 1),
