(6007438, 879203, 83313, '<td valign="top">Guess: <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=30861" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">Bear_Music</a> Not too hard. I think the pics of yourself (Entered by Penny and ''Rook, of course) could have used a heavy dose of Topaz. S''only fair. Just sayin''...</td>', 'Guess:  Bear_Music Not too hard. I think the pics of yourself (Entered by Penny and ''Rook, of course) could have used a heavy dose of Topaz. S''only fair. Just sayin''...', '2010-05-14 16:20:23.000000', NULL, 1),
