(6009925, 879902, 327, '<td valign="top">Lovely. The black and white, the lighting. Just love it.</td>', 'Lovely. The black and white, the lighting. Just love it.', '2010-05-16 21:42:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(6010474, 880348, 5112, '<td valign="top">You made your mum look beautiful!  I like the dark background, it makes the soft green and the beautiful hair colours stand out.  I also like the very genuine expression.  Good work.</td>', 'You made your mum look beautiful!  I like the dark background, it makes the soft green and the beautiful hair colours stand out.  I also like the very genuine expression.  Good work.', '2010-05-17 01:51:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(6010481, 879212, 5112, '<td valign="top">:)  So that''s what he really looks like when he''s working!</td>', ':)  So that''s what he really looks like when he''s working!', '2010-05-17 01:53:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(6010484, 880513, 5112, '<td valign="top">Wow, I like this one!  Good shot.  I also like the shirt, good shirt!</td>', 'Wow, I like this one!  Good shot.  I also like the shirt, good shirt!', '2010-05-17 01:54:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(6011069, 879212, 59029, '<td valign="top">Argh now there''s our Bear, a true American, guarding the East Coast beaches with faithful <strike>blunderbuss</strike> err, <strike>cannon</strike>, errr Canon handy...;-)</td>', 'Argh now there''s our Bear, a true American, guarding the East Coast beaches with faithful blunderbuss err, cannon, errr Canon handy...;-)', '2010-05-17 11:45:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(6011070, 878634, 59029, '<td valign="top">*sigh* I should''ve asked a few more questions at the outset...''Why do you want me in a welding mask and wedding dress at the same time?  And sitting on my cruddy old bench in the backyard, cradling an air rifle?''  And the ''Princess'' thing...?!<br/> <br/>All I have to say is, someone knows I''m a pretty good shot, someone took wayyyy better pics of me than this, and someone has some ''splaining to do! *cracking knuckles* no vote but an 8 if weren''t me!</td>', '*sigh* I should''ve asked a few more questions at the outset...''Why do you want me in a welding mask and wedding dress at the same time?  And sitting on my cruddy old bench in the backyard, cradling an air rifle?''  And the ''Princess'' thing...?! All I have to say is, someone knows I''m a pretty good shot, someone took wayyyy better pics of me than this, and someone has some ''splaining to do! *cracking knuckles* no vote but an 8 if weren''t me!', '2010-05-17 11:45:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(6011076, 880492, 59029, '<td valign="top">love the big comfy sweater she''s wearing, and the way you lit her.  Lovely. 8</td>', 'love the big comfy sweater she''s wearing, and the way you lit her.  Lovely. 8', '2010-05-17 11:50:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(6011084, 880518, 24976, '<td valign="top">I love this shot! Shooting thru the dirty plastic/glass has really added a grungy feel and almost cinematic quality to the shot. Awesome!</td>', 'I love this shot! Shooting thru the dirty plastic/glass has really added a grungy feel and almost cinematic quality to the shot. Awesome!', '2010-05-17 12:00:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(6011238, 879340, 38032, '<td valign="top">an appealing shot - has a nice vibe to it. 7</td>', 'an appealing shot - has a nice vibe to it. 7', '2010-05-17 13:23:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(6011244, 879098, 38032, '<td valign="top">certainly captured a great essence of this person. Well done.</td>', 'certainly captured a great essence of this person. Well done.', '2010-05-17 13:24:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(6011246, 880185, 38032, '<td valign="top">Well taken - I wonder if a crop that positioned the head / hands all int he bottom half of the frame would be more fun.</td>', 'Well taken - I wonder if a crop that positioned the head / hands all int he bottom half of the frame would be more fun.', '2010-05-17 13:25:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(6011263, 880518, 63503, '<td valign="top">I tried several times to come up with the light setup that will result in something like your GREAT portrait, the best I''ve been able to come up with was <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=815212" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">this</a> which falls way short of your result. I am hoping you will tell me about your setup. This is an incredible shot and I would give it a 10 without a doubt, but I am not voting in this challenge. Good luck !!!!</td>', 'I tried several times to come up with the light setup that will result in something like your GREAT portrait, the best I''ve been able to come up with was this which falls way short of your result. I am hoping you will tell me about your setup. This is an incredible shot and I would give it a 10 without a doubt, but I am not voting in this challenge. Good luck !!!!', '2010-05-17 13:39:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(6011264, 879203, 63503, '<td valign="top">Great shot !!</td>', 'Great shot !!', '2010-05-17 13:40:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(6011452, 880264, 16106, '<td valign="top">The lack of light in the eyes hurts what is one of the best images yet.</td>', 'The lack of light in the eyes hurts what is one of the best images yet.', '2010-05-17 15:38:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(6011457, 880325, 16106, '<td valign="top">If you had squared up this shot and gotten rid of the lattice and just gone shoulder to shoulder it would have helped this well lit and delightful shot.</td>', 'If you had squared up this shot and gotten rid of the lattice and just gone shoulder to shoulder it would have helped this well lit and delightful shot.', '2010-05-17 15:42:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(6011461, 880258, 16106, '<td valign="top">I really wish the highlight in the eye in shadow had been in focus. Just a bit more DOF would have sent this very good portrait over into ribbon land.</td>', 'I really wish the highlight in the eye in shadow had been in focus. Just a bit more DOF would have sent this very good portrait over into ribbon land.', '2010-05-17 15:45:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(6011469, 880518, 16106, '<td valign="top">Lovely, evocative and rich, my only 10. I expect it to get about a 5.8, but its damn near perfect for this audience of one.</td>', 'Lovely, evocative and rich, my only 10. I expect it to get about a 5.8, but its damn near perfect for this audience of one.', '2010-05-17 15:52:28.000000', NULL, 1);
