(6012026, 879618, 20957, '<td valign="top">Great imagery. Like the way the line in the flag draws you into the eyes. Would be nice to See a little less melting in towards the right of the shot (hair/head) into the flag.</td>', 'Great imagery. Like the way the line in the flag draws you into the eyes. Would be nice to See a little less melting in towards the right of the shot (hair/head) into the flag.', '2010-05-17 22:45:27.000000', NULL, 1),
