(6012455, 879212, 3746, '<td valign="top">OK, I am thinking this is probably Whiterooks entry.<br/> <br/>Dude, I am still not convinced you dont go out of your way to get low scores.. seriously, all you needed to do was nail the focus on this one and it would of done better than it probably is doing now. But the focus is on the background leaving a slightly out of focus Bear. The shingle behind is pinsharp and the colours and exposure are actually rather good.. Even if you had asked Rob to stand still for a couple of seconds while you pop of a couple of shots would of helped.</td>', 'OK, I am thinking this is probably Whiterooks entry. Dude, I am still not convinced you dont go out of your way to get low scores.. seriously, all you needed to do was nail the focus on this one and it would of done better than it probably is doing now. But the focus is on the background leaving a slightly out of focus Bear. The shingle behind is pinsharp and the colours and exposure are actually rather good.. Even if you had asked Rob to stand still for a couple of seconds while you pop of a couple of shots would of helped.', '2010-05-18 06:23:49.000000', NULL, 1),
