(6014772, 879212, 113591, '<td valign="top">I know his face is outof focus, but with that smile, how can it get 36 votes below 3?? No love in DPC</td>', 'I know his face is outof focus, but with that smile, how can it get 36 votes below 3?? No love in DPC', '2010-05-19 02:31:14.000000', NULL, 0),
(6014788, 879212, 66515, '<td valign="top">aaah the elusive Bear in his natural habitat. He looks quite happy and seems to have wintered well. :)</td>', 'aaah the elusive Bear in his natural habitat. He looks quite happy and seems to have wintered well. :)', '2010-05-19 02:41:53.000000', NULL, 0),
(6014806, 880487, 67258, '<td valign="top">Go you, Max!  And Leo!  Excellent portrait, and certainly very worthy of the blue.</td>', 'Go you, Max!  And Leo!  Excellent portrait, and certainly very worthy of the blue.', '2010-05-19 02:51:56.000000', NULL, 0),
(6014815, 879805, 67258, '<td valign="top">Certainly excellent lighting, and the technicals are faultless, but to me the photo does come over as more of a model shoot than a portrait - it just seems a bit empty, and more about the photographer than the person being photographed.  Also somewhat disappointed to see that the ''DPC User'' has never been active, and indeed has viewed just 31 photos in all her time here.  Nonetheless, I gave you an 8.</td>', 'Certainly excellent lighting, and the technicals are faultless, but to me the photo does come over as more of a model shoot than a portrait - it just seems a bit empty, and more about the photographer than the person being photographed.  Also somewhat disappointed to see that the ''DPC User'' has never been active, and indeed has viewed just 31 photos in all her time here.  Nonetheless, I gave you an 8.', '2010-05-19 02:56:58.000000', NULL, 0),
(6014817, 878634, 5585, '<td valign="top">Great Photo...top 10</td>', 'Great Photo...top 10', '2010-05-19 02:57:10.000000', NULL, 0),
(6014822, 880258, 67258, '<td valign="top">There certainly will be more to come.  I really admired this portrait - it seems to have really captured the person, as well as being technically sound.  Very glad to see it ribbon.</td>', 'There certainly will be more to come.  I really admired this portrait - it seems to have really captured the person, as well as being technically sound.  Very glad to see it ribbon.', '2010-05-19 02:58:31.000000', NULL, 0),
