(6014938, 879618, 3746, '<td valign="top">Relatively happy with this finish. Incredible really how two shots taken at the same session (although with different lighting setups and backgrounds) can finish next to each other. Kev pretty much had the drop on me for the first half of the week, but I managed to pull it back towards the end.<br/> <br/>Also a great battle with my teammate <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=67258" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">SaraR</a> who pipped me to the post in the last day..</td>', 'Relatively happy with this finish. Incredible really how two shots taken at the same session (although with different lighting setups and backgrounds) can finish next to each other. Kev pretty much had the drop on me for the first half of the week, but I managed to pull it back towards the end. Also a great battle with my teammate  SaraR who pipped me to the post in the last day..', '2010-05-19 04:28:32.000000', NULL, 0),
