(6015097, 879865, 28742, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Art Roflmao:</b></div><hr/><i> I am guessing I won''t be the only one to say he loks a lot like "Jack" from "LOST". Excellent portrait! </i></td></tr></table> <br/>Seriously, no one else noticed??<br/><a href="//www.lost6season.com/wp-content/uploads/2009/09/Jack-Shepard.png" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//t0.gstatic.com/images?q=tbn:VHlcjIp6TI3PAM://www.lost6season.com/wp-content/uploads/2009/09/Jack-Shepard.png'', strrpos(''//t0.gstatic.com/images?q=tbn:VHlcjIp6TI3PAM://www.lost6season.com/wp-content/uploads/2009/09/Jack-Shepard.png'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//t0.gstatic.com/images?q=tbn:VHlcjIp6TI3PAM://www.lost6season.com/wp-content/uploads/2009/09/Jack-Shepard.png"/></a></td>', 'Originally posted by Art Roflmao: I am guessing I won''t be the only one to say he loks a lot like "Jack" from "LOST". Excellent portrait!  Seriously, no one else noticed??', '2010-05-19 05:33:55.000000', NULL, 0),
(6015209, 879820, 16106, '<td valign="top">Sorry I cant help you with why it was scored low, i gave it a 7.<br/>I think 3 things lowered your score, smoking is bad for your score, narrow focal plane and shooting from below. i think all 3 add to the image, but ill bet they annoyed those folks who hand out 1s 2s and 3s</td>', 'Sorry I cant help you with why it was scored low, i gave it a 7.I think 3 things lowered your score, smoking is bad for your score, narrow focal plane and shooting from below. i think all 3 add to the image, but ill bet they annoyed those folks who hand out 1s 2s and 3s', '2010-05-19 06:21:15.000000', NULL, 0),
