(6018840, 879203, 76335, '<td valign="top">This <i>needed</i> to ribbon. I wish you had backed off the processing a bit. Still, I''m glad it did as well as it did. Not only an excellent portrait, but a compelling character study as well. Congrats to you both.</td>', 'This needed to ribbon. I wish you had backed off the processing a bit. Still, I''m glad it did as well as it did. Not only an excellent portrait, but a compelling character study as well. Congrats to you both.', '2010-05-20 18:40:37.000000', NULL, 0),
(6018942, 879212, 42198, '<td valign="top">There''s something quite surreal about this shot that I enjoy - the pin-sharp background and OOF subject; honestly - how difficult is that to achieve given the auto-focus mechanisms in most dSLRs? It almost looks like bear was a cut/paste onto that background.<br/> <br/>Anyway, this was the only shot in this challenge that stuck in my head - I was looking forward to seeing if you''d achieved another brown ribbon. :)</td>', 'There''s something quite surreal about this shot that I enjoy - the pin-sharp background and OOF subject; honestly - how difficult is that to achieve given the auto-focus mechanisms in most dSLRs? It almost looks like bear was a cut/paste onto that background. Anyway, this was the only shot in this challenge that stuck in my head - I was looking forward to seeing if you''d achieved another brown ribbon. :)', '2010-05-20 19:59:44.000000', NULL, 0),
